Young entrepreneurs-limiting license
HB0009
requirements.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Harshman, Banks and Washut and
Senator(s) Barlow and Rothfuss
AN ACT relating to counties, cities and towns; prohibiting counties, cities and
towns from requiring a license, permit or other authorization for a business
operated by a minor as specified; and providing for an effective date.
